{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And Moses hurried.</b> Because he feared that He might say more than forty days. And one may say: because Moses saw the Holy One, blessed be He, passing and going before him, and he wished to pray before Him before He was concealed from him. And so they said of blessed memory: when does a person ask his needs of the king? While the king is before him."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:45.192897388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}